    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>About This Project</h1><p>You need to be aware that this is a historic recreation project and doesn't contain any game play that you would expect from a traditional game at this point. The game should be very enjoyable from a historic stand point and for exploring the past. Thank you</p><br><h1>Join our disord</h1><p>Help us with development and feedback by joining the discord </p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A historically based recreation of my home city of Hereford in England UK from the year 1642.  I have pieced together a picture of the city as it once was. Take a step into 17th century life and experience history in full 3D with realistic graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using period maps, illustrations and drawings, together with still existing period buildings in the City and elsewhere;  A scale model of the city as it once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 200 unique enterable buildings together with the the city walls and gates,  the castle and the bridge over the river Wye.  Beyond the gates you can travel the countryside; A 4Km * 4Km map allows you to journey and explore a mile from the city in any direction. With towering cathedrals and churches seen from miles away. A highly interactable environment awaits with many hidden gems to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your character lives and works in the 17th century with all that entails.  Period clothes, money, tools, transport, food, language, writing, to name but a few aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The past is another country: they do things differently there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A historically based recreation of my home city of Hereford in England UK from the year 1642.  I have pieced together a picture of the city as it once was. Take a step into 17th century life and experience history in full 3D with realistic graphics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using period maps, illustrations and drawings, together with still existing period buildings in the City and elsewhere;  A scale model of the city as it once was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Over 200 unique enterable buildings together with the the city walls and gates,  the castle and the bridge over the river Wye.  Beyond the gates you can travel the countryside; A 4Km * 4Km map allows you to journey and explore a mile from the city in any direction. With towering cathedrals and churches seen from miles away. A highly interactable environment awaits with many hidden gems to find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your character lives and works in the 17th century with all that entails.  Period clothes, money, tools, transport, food, language, writing, to name but a few aspects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The past is another country: they do things differently there. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
    "short_description": "A historically based recreation of my home city of Hereford in England UK from the year 1642. I have pieced together a picture of the city as it once was. Take a step into 17th century life and experience history in full 3D with realistic graphics. Explore the whole city and surroundings .",
